<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Overview_Section">Overview Section</span></h2>
<p>The overview section provides a summary of the character.
</p>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Primary_Role">Primary Role</span></h4>
<p>State the major category as well as a shorter specific. ex. "Primary Role: Organization - Chantry"
</p>
<ul><li> Military - Templar, Warden, Guard, Soldier, etc</li>
<li> Worker - Shopkeeper, Smith, Farmer, Servant, Innkeeper, Waitress, Musician, Dancer, Juggler, Singer, etc</li>
<li> Organization - Member of: Chantry, Cult, Circle of Magi, Criminal Organisation</li>
<li> Nobility - Alienage Elder, Dalish Keeper, Dalish First, Dwarf Paragon, Dwarven King, Human King, Noble, etc</li>
<li> Other - only if the character REALLY doesnt fit into the above</li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Class">Class</span></h4>
<p>State the class of the character (and specialisation if relevant)(Warrior, Rogue, Mage). ex. "Class: Mage - Spirit Healer"
</p>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Race">Race</span></h4>
<p>State the race of the character, and if relevant the origin. ex. "Race: Elf (Dalish)"
</p>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Voiced">Voiced</span></h4>
<p>Simple Yes/No for if the character is voiced or not. ex. "Voiced: Yes"
</p>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Quest">Quest</span></h4>
<p>If you have provided more than one quest dialogue, please seperate with commas. State the category and a ~5 word description. ex "Quest: Errand - find missing dog" 
</p>
<ul><li> Errand - player must fetch or deliver an item/other menial task</li>
<li> Rescue - character is rescued/requires escort</li>
<li> Hunt - player must kill certain enemies</li>
<li> Criminal - player must perform a criminal act</li>
<li> Other - provide a short description</li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Requirements_2">Requirements</span></h4>
<p>List the requirements, choosing one of the below ONLY. ex. "Requirement: More Hairstyles"
</p>
<ul><li> More Hairstyles mod</li>
<li> Other asset (included)</li></ul>
<p>Please only use More Hairstyles and content which you have permission to distribute. In the case of More Hairstyles, you do not need to indlude the files, but do need to state it as a requirement.
</p>
