<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Ratha_by_Jackkel_Dragon_and_DahliaLynn_-_1st_place">Ratha by Jackkel Dragon and DahliaLynn - 1st place</span></h2>
<ul><li> <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1819">Dragon Age Nexus Page (Updated to v1.01)</a></b></li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Overview">Overview</span></h3>
<ul><li> Primary Role: Worker - Quartermaster and Archer (for Avvar clan)</li>
<li> Class: Warrior (Archer)</li>
<li> Race: Human (Avvaran Hillswoman)</li>
<li> Voiced: Yes</li>
<li> Quest: Errand - Find amulet</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h3>
<p>Ratha is an Avvaran hillswoman whose husband has been lost in a raid on the "lowlanders." She might join the PC to find her husband, or ask the PC to find his amulet. She may also be a merchant, but not both a merchant and a follower.
</p><p>No matter how hard the PC tries, her husband is dead when found. His amulet can be given to her to complete her quest.
</p><p>Ratha is voiced by DahliaLynn.
</p><p>Notes: 
</p>
<ul><li> Ratha's quest goal is triggered by a plot flag, not an item. The plot flag will give the PC the item.</li>
<li> Ratha's companion flag functions should be configured by the modder before she is used as a companion, as she cannot gain XP or use the party picker.</li>
<li> Ratha could benifit from extra lines as a follower, based on the module's plot.</li>
<li> Ratha's approval hardly does anything in this package, the modder should create scenes in the module that allow change in opinion and create new plot flags for approval (included flags are for debug purposes.)</li>
<li> Ratha should be equipped with proper gear in the toolset before being used as a companion.</li>
<li> Ratha's Follower flag must be set before meeting her to work. Merchant flag may be set at any time, but will only work if she is not a follower.</li></ul>
<p>Points Note:
</p>
<ul><li> 1st: 8 Jackkel / 7 DahliaLynn (total 15)</li>
<li> 2nd: 5 Jackkel / 5 DahliaLynn (total 10)</li>
<li> 3rd: 2 Jackkel / 3 DahliaLynn (total 5)</li>
<li> Entry: 1 Jackkel / 1 DahliaLynn</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Judges_Comments">Judges Comments</span></h3>
<p><b>mikemike37</b>
Really well made character with equally careful voice acting and staging. Character is fairly specific-case, though: references are made to "lowlanders" as well as the type of settlement, so be careful to use this character in a suitable setting (highland village).
</p><p><br />
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Knives_by_Vaylise_-_2nd_Place">Knives by Vaylise  - 2nd Place</span></h2>
<ul><li> <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1821">Dragon Age Nexus Page</a></b></li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Overview_2">Overview</span></h3>
<ul><li> Primary Role: Organization - Criminal Organization</li>
<li> Race: Elf</li>
<li> Class: Rogue</li>
<li> Voiced: No</li>
<li> Quest: Other – Start bar fight </li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Description_2">Description</span></h3>
<p>Knives has a sharp tongue and is prone to making threats of bodily harm when things don’t go the way she wants. She can be found selling stolen merchandise, starting brawls, or even just massacring darkspawn.
</p><p>Note:
She has some basic skill, gender, merchant and follower flags set, however, none of the approval and plot flags have been done. 
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Judges_Comments_2">Judges Comments</span></h3>
<p><b>mikemike37</b>
